  "notes": "One official RuNEB ZIP download yielded three intact provider-named PDF parts derived from an RNL physical copy. The acquired digital Item contains 22 photographed surfaces, including the title page and selected spreads through printed pages 138-139. It is deliberately labeled fragmentary and is not equated with the complete cataloged 236-page Edition, an accepted transcription, or any Antonovsky Expression.",
